{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>向來熱愛小動物的歌手鄭融（Stephanie），近日趁工作空檔遠赴希臘度假享受陽光與海灘，豈料這趟旅程卻為她帶來一場暖心奇遇。鄭融於社交平台分享，指自己在當地一個下雨的下午，於垃圾站旁偶遇一隻患上感冒的流浪貓BB，她與同行友人二話不說將小貓救起並悉心照料，令小貓在短短三日內回復精神，善舉獲大批網民激讚。</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭融在希臘度假救起病弱流浪貓BB。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199758303933501440756948.jpeg/RqUXp0bqA1hcf0mz6r7LYDjpIeV3_EFZ_u2n6P7tp-g\"/><figcaption>鄭融在希臘度假救起病弱流浪貓BB。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"即刻救助餵食。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199758300556955648852104.jpeg/V-x8CVxgWsjsKXCk0qjvPxAaPyMKdwQaGSKs4RkirOE\"/><figcaption>即刻救助餵食。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"細心照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199758297985716224082469.jpeg/83XEgBHxdzBzIGKHNMRxe6TpKb4nljTyvP_br7z_268\"/><figcaption>細心照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><p>鄭融雨中垃圾站旁發現病貓</p><p>鄭融在帖文中憶述當時情況，指事發當日希臘正下著雨，她在垃圾站附近發現一隻獨自徘徊、而且正患上感冒的幼貓。見小貓孤苦無依且身體虛弱，鄭融與同行友人立即決定出手相助。由於事出突然，身邊未有齊全的養貓用品，幸好同行有一位具養貓經驗的朋友，隨即出動多項「應急法寶」為小貓急救。</p><p>鄭融寫道：「有經驗嘅朋友馬上去了買濕糧，搣碎廁紙俾BB頂住做臨時貓廁所，用菊花茶開水幫小貓抹眼睛抹面。」（獸醫學界指出，菊科植物多含除蟲菊酯（Pyrethrins）等成分，對貓咪肝臟代謝及神經具潛在毒性，且茶水非無菌溶液易致二次感染。清潔幼貓眼面應以無菌生理鹽水或溫水為宜。）一行人亦第一時間聯絡當地獸醫診所，惟診所預約爆滿，要待兩日後才能應診。</p><figure><img alt=\"友人出動「應急法寶」照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199758295229927424342951.jpeg/55oCJR85SY-Psyem7eJ9VmT84gM_sd9cXUSlH11EpR8\"/><figcaption>友人出動「應急法寶」照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760144074805248402576.jpeg/NijhhhKVQ3se9lkz5wDCPpJrRIpdswQWCQOwsAkDsLA\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760146876731392653914.jpeg/Y7K7M46b1zjuAfl6Ljf0DEKSbrB1tE2F9jmeAvY5ngI\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760149343113216816542.jpeg/H6tkC14nr1ppmM_UJ2kEZRM3J0Kp6R5agYJ07IGCdOw\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760152191176704680953.jpeg/QMs4k3WsnW_DOdBPAWpaL10K5dJoayUvvmbKsb5myrE\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760154934382592397164.jpeg/ql586hQ7e7-S7SwU7eqmxJ9eagx1y02Wp0DOJKdAziQ\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760120414736384657412.jpeg/T7kpjismdVf_cqmEeSIIoYU-6nT-6to7WzlEiVs5RIk\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199760123376046080964510.jpeg/XgBlhcaMXl7CZMC6A0SQt-9fwAD_u2ZHpoPrBqaD6wY\"/><figcaption>可愛貓貓。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure><p>細心照料三日肚仔脹卜卜　網民大讚「人美心善」</p><p>雖然未能即時求醫，但在鄭融與友人的細心照料下，貓BB的情況很快迎來好轉。鄭融欣喜地表示，到了第三日小貓的精神已明顯恢復，胃口大開：「第三日感恩BB精神都好返好多，食到個肚仔都變咗個乒乓波，好快有得睇醫生了。」   面對這個突如其來的小生命，鄭融感觸良多，直言：「一個決定真係可以改寫生命，BB好鍾意你呀，你令我嘅旅程增添意義同快樂。」帖文曝光後，隨即吸引大批圈中好友及網民留言，紛紛大讚她「人美心善」、「畫面好治癒」，又指貓BB非常有福氣能遇到她。更有不少網民留言起鬨，紛紛呼籲鄭融乾脆「收編」這隻希臘貓BB，將牠帶回香港生活，讓這段跨國緣分延續下去。</p><figure><img alt=\"友人出動「應急法寶」照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261118/1199758292071485440790458.jpeg/Xr6rgcCKqqIWgJwM6wL_8DI6ChvKXV5cvj3PmL49z5g\"/><figcaption>友人出動「應急法寶」照料。（IG@stephanie_cheng）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:44:08.010981+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1116,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:37:26.252105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:37:26.252105+00:00","content_hash":"4432bbe21119166b86a4ea364fcd9c64945cbfb93dd8c7a350060cc4cbee607a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}